{"server":"tw","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_04_beg","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_04","title":"非傳統藝術空間","storyCode":"CR-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"10d12788e9be2b9310c17b07a8201cc1b82c349319f030c1c3b4074a7d78dc89","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，只要我還在這裡一天，那幾個雷內爾的手下就別想參與到我們藝術節中來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"藝術節就在眼前了，這個節骨眼上我必須保證萬無一失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們不都把藥還回來了，雷內爾不也沒反對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道他們這麼做揣的是什麼心思？你能保證他們沒有惡意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，你為什麼不說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹，我知道他們是雷內爾的人，報紙上到處都是他們和雷內爾的照片，我沒辦法幫他們辯駁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可那天我礦石病發作，倒在地上動彈不得，周圍一個人也沒有……我想，或許那一刻真的來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在我準備坦然接受一切時，他們來了，救起了我，將我送回到社區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹，很多年前，那場火災裡，我的心情也是一樣絕望。但你來了，救了我，將我帶出火場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這怎麼能一樣呢，特克諾？我是個消防員，救你就是救你，本職而已，什麼都不圖。他們呢？你能保證嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你擔心，我會找人盯緊他們的。就讓他們看看我們在做什麼，好嗎，老爹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，你怎麼這麼固執？你為他們做擔保……如果真的出事大家第一個怪罪的就是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"求你了，老爹，我不會讓他們搗亂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，又來，每次跟我一有爭論，你就開始撒嬌……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……拜託啦求你了，老爹……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，別再眨眼了，沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是這一套以前明明很有用的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說呢？以前你這頭髮還不是紅紅綠綠的，你這身上還不是烏漆麻黑的，你走起路來也不是噹啷作響的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這孩子……唉，以前清清爽爽的不好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，別噘嘴了，讓他們領頭的女人來找我，我有幾句話和她說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，去那片沙灘。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_beach_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA小姐，知道我為什麼找你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該不是來看風景？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在雷內爾手下做事，見識到的美景肯定不少，這片普通的沙灘入不了你們的眼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好說，在一條布滿垃圾的小巷後面卻是一片乾淨的沙灘，即使是太陽快落山的現在，光照也比社區好很多，我還蠻驚喜的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光照沒什麼辦法，社區裡建築又多又高又亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於垃圾……以前堆在這裡的垃圾比小巷裡的還多，管事後，我親自帶著人清理乾淨，誰要是敢再丟，都會被我狠狠教訓一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，只要是來到多索雷斯的人，就該有機會享受屬於自己的沙灘時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說得對不對，ELA小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞茲先生，我不是來這裡丟垃圾的，我只是想跟你一樣，坐下看看風景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒有浮誇喧嘩的遊客，也沒有鋪天蓋地的賭場廣告，只是一片乾淨的沙灘，我很喜歡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡安靜只是因為總是強風，所以不會有人來開發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到了，這裡的樹只有背風一側長葉子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們很強韌，逆著風也能茁壯生長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……抱歉，我的本地話學得不是很道地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA小姐……你們說要看看，那我們也沒什麼好藏的，但記住，看的時候管好自己的手，別碰不該碰的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾喜歡和你們待在一起，社區裡的大家也很歡迎你們，所以就讓我來扮這個黑臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要是敢辜負她的信任，讓她傷心，我就算是拼了老命也要讓你們付出代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亞茲先生，你對特克諾小姐實在是有些過度關照了，她只是你的屬下，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這一輩子沒結婚沒孩子，把她從火中救出後，在我心裡，她就是我的孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亞茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的話就講到這裡，你們自己評估著看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真是個愛操心的老父親。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g8_srcroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）一種以不可或缺的工業礦物為源頭的傳染病，起病隱匿，症狀多樣，癒後極差，迄今無法根治……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）難以想像，要是石油突然成為一種絕症的傳染源……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古斯塔夫先生，你剛剛在跟我說話嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我只是在自言自語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的儀器和藥品，我都幫你拿來了，你看看還缺什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想應該是夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自從負責這片社區的醫生離開後，專業的醫護人員就沒剩幾個人了，你能來幫忙，大家都鬆了口氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那本有關礦石病的筆記就是他留下的，帶病操勞那麼多年，他也是……唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從筆記上的字跡來看，他是個耐心細緻的醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們都很懷念他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，還有，關於你們要找的人……我已經找信使加急把你們的消息送過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道那幾位幹員是不是你們要找的人，我和他們也只不過有幾次擦肩而過而已。但……有希望總比沒有好，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。真的太感謝你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過……信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們沒有國際長途嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"國際……長途？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"埃內斯托先生，我今天預約了看診，時間已經到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，是你啊，艾尼。這就是我們新來的醫生，古斯塔夫先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"古斯塔夫先生你好，我媽媽做了麵包，要我帶給新醫生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，請替我謝謝她，是什麼麵包？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"可頌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，小朋友。Croissant，你應該這麼唸才對。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪，沒人這麼唸啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，這就是最標準的讀法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龍舌蘭","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，公認的標準讀法難道不是——“可頌”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……太荒唐了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"稚嫩的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"DOC，你還好嗎？你的臉色好蒼白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"DOC","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，沒事……小朋友，你最近有什麼症狀？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！你們兩個，那隻手臂還要再吊高一點，一會才能順利和肩膀銜接上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓如此巨大的兩隻木偶共舞……你們真是敢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從設計到製作完成花了大半年的時間，這麼一看，不枉大家花費在上面的心思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你提出要這麼做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？不是哦，其實計劃最初是老爹提出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪、迪亞茲先生？想不到他居然……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火災發生的那年天氣特別乾燥，社區裡的舞廳起火後，火勢非常兇猛，很多人都被困在裡面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時是老爹不顧上級的命令，執意前來救火，但他拼盡全力也沒能救出所有人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事成了大家心裡共同的傷疤，誰都不願提及。帶著傷痛，誰也不能像從前那樣盡情舞蹈到天明了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年裡，很多人都陸續走出來了，那些想要起舞的渴望又回到了我們身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了老爹……他一直很內疚，為那些他沒能救出來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他卻起頭提出了這個計劃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爹說，既然他不能與大家共舞，那就做那個呼喚大家來跳舞的人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，特克諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我第一次來到這裡時很驚訝，社區規劃很混亂，有大量的違章建築，人口密度又高，按理說消防安全應該有很大隱患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在街頭巷尾，隨處可見分布合理的消防設施，隨便哪棟大樓都有快速疏散的安全通道與樓梯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我就在想，管這個地方的傢伙還挺了不起的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在看來，我想得一點沒錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那當然了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，什麼情況？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？好像那隻手臂停在那裡不動了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕，手臂移位時與木偶身體上的繩索發生了絞扭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能分離後重新調整位置嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，卡得死死的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡在什麼位置，派人手動去解開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"有些困難，卡死位置在三層和四層的中間，離窗戶很遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用安全索吊下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"或許……可以試試？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然吊下來一個人手動處理，而且從八層下來？那裡比木偶的頭部還高出不少，這會不會太危險了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能從八層放繩子……下面那幾層根本沒有合適的條件固定繩索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能遠端操控機器來處理嗎……啊，那片建築外牆幾乎沒有什麼著力點供攀爬……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個木偶是手工製作，內部結構很複雜……只能由熟悉的人來弄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心點啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差一點……再往左一點點就能夠到——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了！技師摔下去了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g9_gangsters"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……還好，安全索拉著，人沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他能再試一次嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不行……那傢伙好像嚇壞了，兩隻腳都在發抖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顫抖的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，大哥……我真的不行，我懼高症……我、我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指揮人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_1274_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你是最清楚那裡構造的技師了……換了別人上手只會更困難……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顫抖的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不……太可怕了，剛剛摔下去的時候，我以為自己要死了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顫抖的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要、要不找特克諾？她、她是設計的人……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g8_slums"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾！特克諾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傢伙人沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"他沒事，就是害怕得不行，所以領隊叫我來找你，看看你能不能上去試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我完全不懂裡面的構造啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"可這不是你的設計嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這樣，但我只是設計了外觀，後續技術上如何實現並不在我的專業範圍內……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那可怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，能讓我和FUZE試試嗎？我們對工程機械都有些瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？ELA小姐，老爹他跟你聊完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們上去試試吧，特克諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是老爹不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾，我也可以。我們都有一些工程背景，肯定幫得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"作業人員","speakerId":"avg_npc_001","isRemote":false,"text":"這位小姐，你不怕高嗎？那可是在第八層……光是懂技術是遠遠不夠的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我曾經從二十層高樓速降至地面，這對我來說是小事一樁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不行……不用你們去，我自己去就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特克諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，ELA，我不是不相信你，只是我和老爹做了保證，無論如何也不能讓你們參與到其中來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你真的能解決嗎，特克諾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會盡全力的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能幫我個忙嗎，邁耶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那邊有幾個人正在盯著我，等等他們來追我的話幫我擋一下，我去找FUZE。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，迪亞茲老爺子的額外部署。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以是可以，你去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去上面，特克諾搞不定那個大傢伙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ELA！喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"專注的社區守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，那女人要去哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，打擾了，有件事還想請您幫我個忙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"專注的社區守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"專注的社區守衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"IANA","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可別倒在這裡啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米沃什？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位來自伊比利亞的機械修復師我帶來了，你現在有空見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，快請她進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷內爾先生，請問是什麼物件需要修復？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是桌上這件音樂盒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔……十五年前轟動一時的傑作，出自著名設計師阿莉琪婭之手……真美啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感受到一陣令人心悅的溫馨寧靜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看蓋子上雕刻的女性面容，多麼安詳美麗，眼神中帶著的悲憫，嘴角上隱隱的苦澀意味，真是難以言喻的美麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，女士，不用再重述了，這些天我和它朝夕相處，知道它的每一個細節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它的音筒損壞得很嚴重，我也不知道是否能復原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個音筒是我弄壞的，我不需要你將它復原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在盒子的夾層裡有張樂譜，我希望你能依照它重製一個新的音筒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夾層？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"拿起桌上的音樂盒，男人將它倒過來，指尖輕輕一勾，竟將原本嚴絲合縫的底板取了下來，露出裡面被折起的字條。\n泛黃的紙面說明它在裡面已經有些年頭了，雷內爾小心翼翼地展開它，輕輕放在桌子上。\n那是一張手寫的樂譜，字跡清秀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"修復師","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是怎麼知道底下有夾層的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷內爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_1211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，因為我母親製作它的時候我就在旁邊，我親眼看著她將字條放進去的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定我們要從這裡上到八樓然後速降嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，這是抵達那裡最便捷的路徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也很危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不相信我們的安全索嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我相信你，但這裡有人不歡迎我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一旦有人決意針對我們，這樣眾目睽睽之下的行動會讓我們成為眾矢之的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的話比往常要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也比平常更不理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是不想讓他們的想法落空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼非要替這些異想天開的藝術家操心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不喜歡異想天開這個詞嗎？它意味著挑戰一系列不可能，最終達成自己的目標，讓所有人驚掉下巴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如此說來，我們的每一次行動都可以被視為一場異想天開的創作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能說不是呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速降之後你的動作得快點，很快就會有人找到我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"FUZE","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過也不用太緊張，我會為你爭取足夠的時間。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ELA","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
